The relevant types JellyfinDbContext and BaseItem are not found in the repo, so I cannot mock them precisely. I will write a test that mocks the dependencies and verifies the logger call by mocking the library manager and persistence service, and using a minimal fake DbContext with in-memory data for the duplicate items. I will mock the logger interface IStartupLogger<T> as ILogger<T> since the extension method LogInformation is on ILogger.

I will submit a test that calls PerformAsync and verifies the logger call for the duplicate removal step.

